Self Intro: 

I am an NYU Math and CS undergrad, working with Lerrel Pinto at the NYU CILVR Group. My research focuses on full system Robot Learning, Reinforcement Learning, and World Model, with great interest in multimodal robot. I am excited to bring robotics from fiction to real-world one day. 

If you find my research interesting or want to discuss futher, feel free to connect!